        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In the interest of promoting harmonious and cooperative relations between the University of Alaska and United Academics, the parties hereby agree to the following terms for the resolution of disputes.",
            "block_bbox": [
                246,
                353,
                1008,
                438
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    246.0,
                    353.0
                ],
                [
                    1008.0,
                    353.0
                ],
                [
                    1008.0,
                    438.0
                ],
                [
                    246.0,
                    438.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "7.1 Definitions",
            "block_bbox": [
                176,
                460,
                386,
                493
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    176.0,
                    460.0
                ],
                [
                    386.0,
                    460.0
                ],
                [
                    386.0,
                    493.0
                ],
                [
                    176.0,
                    493.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. A \"grievance\" is:",
            "block_bbox": [
                247,
                515,
                491,
                545
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    247.0,
                    515.0
                ],
                [
                    491.0,
                    515.0
                ],
                [
                    491.0,
                    545.0
                ],
                [
                    247.0,
                    545.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "i. an allegation by a unit member or United Academics that there has been a specifically cited allegation of procedural errors or omissions made in reaching decisions involving academic judgment; or",
            "block_bbox": [
                318,
                566,
                1042,
                681
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    318.0,
                    566.0
                ],
                [
                    1042.0,
                    566.0
                ],
                [
                    1042.0,
                    681.0
                ],
                [
                    318.0,
                    681.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "ii. an allegation by a unit member, United Academics, or the University that an express term of the Agreement has been violated, misinterpreted or improperly applied; or",
            "block_bbox": [
                319,
                701,
                964,
                787
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    319.0,
                    701.0
                ],
                [
                    964.0,
                    701.0
                ],
                [
                    964.0,
                    787.0
                ],
                [
                    319.0,
                    787.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "iii. an allegation by a unit member or United Academics that there has been a violation of Regents' Policy or University Regulation to the extent it concerns a term and condition of employment as defined in the Public Employment Relations Act.",
            "block_bbox": [
                318,
                808,
                1042,
                921
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    318.0,
                    808.0
                ],
                [
                    1042.0,
                    808.0
                ],
                [
                    1042.0,
                    921.0
                ],
                [
                    318.0,
                    921.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. A \"complaint\" is an allegation by a unit member or United Academics involving substantive academic judgments.",
            "block_bbox": [
                246,
                942,
                1003,
                1000
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    246.0,
                    942.0
                ],
                [
                    1003.0,
                    942.0
                ],
                [
                    1003.0,
                    1000.0
                ],
                [
                    246.0,
                    1000.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. A \"grievant\" is the party alleging a grievance.",
            "block_bbox": [
                246,
                1022,
                767,
                1052
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    246.0,
                    1022.0
                ],
                [
                    767.0,
                    1022.0
                ],
                [
                    767.0,
