                    1265.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "f. A \"filing\" is the receipt of a written grievance or complaint by personal delivery, certified mail or facsimile. If personal delivery is used, the administrator shall provide a written receipt. If certified mail is used, the return receipt shall establish the date of delivery. If facsimile is used, the",
